# HostFS's messages, in TAIRiX Bridge's own words.
Locked:That object is locked
Exists:That name is already taken
DiscFull:The disc is full
Protected:That disc may not be changed
BadName:RISC OS cannot spell that name
Ambiguous:Two names differ only in case, and neither is the one asked for
NotEmpty:That directory is not empty
Access:That is not allowed
NoDisc:There is no disc of that name
TooLarge:That file is too large for RISC OS
Unkept:That disc cannot keep what was asked of it
Failed:HostFS could not reach its discs
